# Data files
# Anchored to the repo root for the same reason as /Documents/ below: unanchored, `data/` matched
# any nested directory named `data`, which silently excluded the admin routes at
# app/admin/data/ and app/api/admin/data/ — they type-checked and tested locally but could
# never be committed or deployed.
/data/
public/location-photos.json

# Business documents (local only — multi-GB scans/exports, never commit)
# Anchored to the repo root: unanchored, this also matched any nested
# `documents/` directory, and git is case-insensitive on macOS, so it silently
# excluded the admin route at app/admin/archive/documents/.
/Documents/

# Examples and docs
examples/
docs/backstage/

